      "role": "user",
      "content": "i messed up something so bad. like, it isnt just a mistake at work. i actually ruined someone's life by being careless. i look in the mirror and i dont even see a person anymore, just this mistake that keeps breathing. i feel like i'm just a stain on everything i touch.",
